    48	
    49	It also required the engine to report “`m_target`, `m_tx` and the realised outcome separately per user-step.” Source: [v1.8 amendment, §8](/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-PHYSICS-SUCCESSOR-PRIORITY-DECLARATION-v1.8-AMENDMENT-2026-09-09.md:12). The text therefore expressly distinguishes the rate-target mode from the transmitted mode.
