/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-astra-ws/ADJUDICATION-ASTRA-2026-09-10.md:3:This project cannot presently support its stated positive three-route EE claim. The defensible affirmative result is a finite-panel, offline search comparison with an explicitly stronger information class. Eventual feasibility of the learned claim is **UNDETERMINED**. That distinction is consequential: failure to establish efficacy does not establish impossibility or equivalence.
